# Data Validation

After ingestion, it is important to verify that logs are arriving correctly.

Example KQL query:

```kusto
MeridianLogs_CL
| take 10
```

This query retrieves sample records from the custom table.

Other useful validation queries include:

```kusto
MeridianLogs_CL
| count
```

```kusto
MeridianLogs_CL
| summarize count() by Computer
```

Validation should always be performed before creating detections.

