# Best Practices

When implementing log ingestion:

- Collect only necessary telemetry.
- Validate ingestion after every configuration change.
- Monitor ingestion health regularly.
- Standardize log formats where possible.
- Secure API keys and credentials.
- Document ingestion workflows.
- Review ingestion costs periodically.

---

